atlas commands-spines-owner

architecture native-spines-bun-owner
  canonical_name NativeSpinesBunOwner
  family commands
  domain Execution / Temporal maintenance, bounded reasoning and candidate placement
  maturity measured
  semantic_question Can temporal consequences, pure reduction witnesses and model placement compose through native executables without letting representation or a candidate plan become authority?
  purpose Retire the installed R5-R7 Python coordinator and CLI into Bun owners over existing C executables and the original SQLite state.
  node_types FluxEvent
  node_types LogicalDelta
  node_types AffectedClosure
  node_types StandingView
  node_types RewriteRule
  node_types BoundedReduction
  node_types AuthorityPreflight
  node_types ExecutionPhenotype
  node_types CandidatePlacement
  node_types ChainedReceipt
  internal_calculus immutable flux -> logical delta and native chunk witness -> affected closure -> standing views -> replay parity
  internal_calculus bounded term rewrites -> cost extraction -> helix native execution -> witness -> candidate proof
  internal_calculus observed inventory and hardware -> phenotype -> eligibility constraints -> candidate placement and fuse
  invariant twenty-nine tool contracts remain on one authenticated bounded MCP transport; legacy proof-writing reads are serialized as effects
  invariant STOP refuses new mutations including hidden proof writes; historical records are not replayed or relabelled on startup
  invariant chained receipts preserve Python numeric-source and Unicode canonicalization and bind document fields to their SQLite row
  invariant composite mission attempts persist intent and uncertain outcomes; no automatic effect retry after partial completion
  forbidden_inference kernel CPU reference parity -> GPU execution, model quality or arbitrary backend verification
  forbidden_inference discovered runtime executable -> verified model weights or viable inference
  forbidden_inference candidate proof, placement or fuse -> authority to execute external or irreversible effects
  forbidden_inference local migration tests or warm inventory reads -> whole-system scaling or complete Python retirement
